muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/ab6fac28b2570a57378751a540ef6639.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/ab6fac28b2570a57378751a540ef6639.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/ab6fac28b2570a57378751a540ef6639.mp4?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turrets and bullets</h2>Don't forget to dodge those turrets, bullets, mines, you name it. Watch every turn and action in case it's a fatal one!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/5013c404baa6b931eb64469f4bfd3693.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/5013c404baa6b931eb64469f4bfd3693.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/5013c404baa6b931eb64469f4bfd3693.mp4?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teleports gone wrong</h2>Running behind a little? Make sure to take advantage of those teleports, shortcuts and what ever else can increase your changes of winning, but be precise about it or it ay backfire!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/252e2b578e1becf45aa992136ca9880b.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/252e2b578e1becf45aa992136ca9880b.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"